OL,3,ANavi Pillay, former UN human rights
OL,4,Acommissioner, wins Nobel Peace Prize
OL,5,
OL,6,FNavi Pillay, a former UN human rights
OL,7,Fcommissioner, wins the Nobel Peace
OL,8,FPrize 2026 - here's a bit about her
OL,9,Flife
OL,11,FPillay is recognised for her "efforts
OL,12,Fto promote peace and international
OL,13,Flaw", the Norwegian Nobel Committee
OL,14,Fsays
OL,16,FAfter being told she has won, Pillay
OL,17,Fjokes that she doesn't quite believe
OL,18,Fthe news is real, going on to have a
OL,19,Fjibe at the US president: "If you clap
OL,20,Fa little bit more I may share this
OL,21,Fprize with Trump"
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
